CM W1ZR Skeleton Sleeve Dipole
CM
CM Ref. 2011.05 QST pg. 58
CM Author: Willard Myers, K1GQ.
CM Dimensions, wire and insulation properties from EZNEC model by Joel, W1ZR.
CE
SY r=awg18
SY wireSigma=5.7471E7
SY insulationPermittivity=2.25
SY insulationRadius=2.074E-3
SY l1=(30.9ft)/2 ! QST says 30.833'
! QST says 30.833'
SY l2=(55.9ft)/2 ! QST says 56.333'
! QST says 56.333'
SY l3=l1+4.2in ! QST say gap 4"
! QST say gap 4"
SY s=0.72in
SY h=25ft
GW 1,102,-l1,0,h,l1,0,h,r
GW 2,183,-l2,0,h-s,l2,0,h-s,r
GW 3,63,-l2,0,h,-l3,0,h,r
GW 4,63,l2,0,h,l3,0,h,r
GW 5,1,-l2,0,h,-l2,0,h-s,r
GW 6,1,l2,0,h,l2,0,h-s,r
GE 0
EX 0,2,92,0,1,0
GN 0,0,0,0,13,0.005
FR 0,7,0,0,7,0.05
RP 0,37,73,1000,0,0,5,5
FR 0,8,0,0,14,0.05
RP 0,37,73,1000,0,0,5,5
